Kaikēyī vows Rāma exile and Bharata crowning --- Kaikēyī seeks means to crown Bharata alone --- Mantharā recalls war rescue and two boons --- Mantharā bids lie dirty-clad silent in anger chamber --- Mantharā bids demand Bharata crowning and fourteen-year Rāma exile --- Mantharā urges refuse gifts and bind Daśaratha by oath --- Mantharā notes Bharata will take root during exile --- Kaikēyī praises Mantharā and promises gold and garlands --- Mantharā warns against delay and leads to anger chamber --- Kaikēyī strips jewels and lies wroth threatening death
